        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "I once heard someone say they believed my grandmom didn't make one enemy in her life. And if she did, she probably invited them over for dinner,. and after one taste of her deep-dish peach cobbler, they were sure grandmom's opponent made amends."
